Breaker: vpinball
Description: Visual Pinball X - Pinball simulator
 Visual Pinball X is an open source pinball table editor and simulator.
 It simulates pinball table physics and renders the table with OpenGL.
 Features include:
  - Pinball table physics simulation
  - Multiple rendering backends (OpenGL, bgfx)
  - VR/XR support
  - Plugin system for DMD, backglass, and other displays
  - Table logic controlled via Visual Basic Script
  - Emulation of real pinball machines via PinMAME
 .
 This package includes the main application and necessary libraries.
 .
 Tables are available from community repositories.

